{"id": "clm:1299967eed91f521b8979d1137a89392e329e91e034dd1539b6e067f3fba9581", "type": "statement", "text": "A diagnostic gist created on 2023-08-15 contains Atlas-named hosts and maxIndexBuildMemoryUsageMegabytes=250. It demonstrates a historical configured value, but does not identify an Atlas tier or establish a current service default. (low confidence) (verified as of 2023-08-15)", "source_url": "https://gist.github.com/Salil999/ff0ca3f9a08021c038bcd7aef2a03dc1", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "structure", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:26794c6658014eba088c698d77929215c47c4b1e2f9989590b493781318ff648", "ev:304591b57a6504fd15fffd1f76e8be6d3a4a67d8147ab920ddec0612ec50e9dc", "ev:d4ba4861a81aced280185159fb7853fbc2cff00dfc2d1cc58d1a9a83ed7b290e"]}
{"id": "clm:4e12d966b816494acc7c852e12e176c502d690105a6393ced9c4f56107a7e49d", "type": "statement", "text": "The index-build memory allowance is shared across indexes created by one createIndexes command, separately from WiredTiger cache memory; exceeding the allowance causes temporary files to be used. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.3/reference/parameters/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0b8f4eaa560627ddee46bc481b7f6f7b024984b008dc6bd65e2bb9c6e8d0ecc5", "ev:c1565aec862a551791f63106d7d6ccce7e61da502ca4c9426af0f090329f8364"]}
{"id": "clm:ec64662acec98abf97f20561998fc2e579b1a8ff4390e7dea0beab431dc28df2", "type": "statement", "text": "A createIndexes request consumes one concurrency slot even when it builds multiple indexes; the request shares its memory budget among those indexes. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/parameters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.3/reference/parameters/", "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c1565aec862a551791f63106d7d6ccce7e61da502ca4c9426af0f090329f8364", "ev:dd4af918c86cca7b2a88b47f94718348028dc5ad2d29f7fb6925cc3df4c10496"]}
{"id": "clm:af3d11f4a7b78e01af00c4539d798a38f2963a02f6c796d180c0275e728bd160", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas maxIndexBuildMemoryUsageMegabytes defaults are M10–M20: 100 MB; M30: 250 MB; M40: 400 MB; M50–M60: 512 MB; M80–M140: 1024 MB; M200+: 2048 MB. The documentation labels tiers as comparable to instance-RAM bands. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/parameters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.3/reference/parameters/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0b8f4eaa560627ddee46bc481b7f6f7b024984b008dc6bd65e2bb9c6e8d0ecc5"]}
{"id": "clm:fc780043a657e7a5b0f5cf1ac657f7eb828b83a306778fdf03b2eb89aed694d8", "type": "statement", "text": "The generic 200 MB per-createIndexes default is explicitly scoped to self-hosted deployments; it should not replace the Atlas tier table in capacity estimates. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.3/reference/parameters/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0b8f4eaa560627ddee46bc481b7f6f7b024984b008dc6bd65e2bb9c6e8d0ecc5", "ev:c1565aec862a551791f63106d7d6ccce7e61da502ca4c9426af0f090329f8364"]}
{"id": "clm:1aae17b7ff0e2e33b473605d6b308f4d712b121d163ba6358c8c1b4134aa31fd", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona’s August 5, 2019 article describes a 500 MB default and configurable memory, so its figures should not substitute for the current Atlas tier table. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.percona.com/blog/mongodb-impact-free-index-builds-using-detached-replicaset-nodes/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "measures", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/parameters.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3036693b8a37b2d72bf442773692e3832b35b2ce588b05f85a2b20ffcf298d85", "ev:3e0256b830109192eb5b3e5924bd151b6f0121231266206589c0a2df00a927db"]}
{"id": "clm:a1074c67f694442008b75c27cdb25ae1d42acf22fff496133421917aec7fdc21", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB documents Atlas index-build memory values as cluster-tier defaults that users cannot change. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.3/reference/parameters/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0b8f4eaa560627ddee46bc481b7f6f7b024984b008dc6bd65e2bb9c6e8d0ecc5", "ev:c1565aec862a551791f63106d7d6ccce7e61da502ca4c9426af0f090329f8364"]}
{"id": "clm:ca10a48db4c34bc60f16d005d23ebfe23578ab04bd718a3808b2329bb712fdad", "type": "statement", "text": "The generic 200 MB memory and three-concurrent-build defaults describe self-managed deployments; Atlas uses tier-specific values. Memory exhaustion during sorting can spill to temporary files rather than immediately aborting the build. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-19)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/parameters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b885fdabae41d24e537392cdff2bf7c8018052d79070d9f7c3ee7cf69d3dc58b", "ev:c1565aec862a551791f63106d7d6ccce7e61da502ca4c9426af0f090329f8364"]}
{"id": "clm:44c22e09ee17afc2b29978064453ec0b753093ec58a273bd70f0ba22e0d4c749", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas maxNumActiveUserIndexBuilds defaults are 1 for M10–M40, 2 for M50–M60, and 3 for M80 and above including NVMe variants; corresponding low-CPU R tiers use the same defaults. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/parameters.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.3/reference/parameters/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:dd4af918c86cca7b2a88b47f94718348028dc5ad2d29f7fb6925cc3df4c10496"]}
{"id": "clm:41381588715c6f9f6fa314cc17c80467568b673c450915f960b6642bdbafce62", "type": "statement", "text": "A diagnostic gist created August 15, 2023 records maxIndexBuildMemoryUsageMegabytes=250 and maxNumActiveUserIndexBuilds=3. It is a deployment snapshot, not a current tier-default specification. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://gist.github.com/Salil999/ff0ca3f9a08021c038bcd7aef2a03dc1", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas index build tier defaults"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:40ad19239ecb31bed8ad693f7fd5d452561c77a9e897acaf4196c054370d5767", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:26794c6658014eba088c698d77929215c47c4b1e2f9989590b493781318ff648", "ev:d4ba4861a81aced280185159fb7853fbc2cff00dfc2d1cc58d1a9a83ed7b290e"]}
